WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.018 --> 00:00:02.524
File scans in notes

2
00:00:02.524 --> 00:00:06.394
Open Import scanned pages from the scan icon in the ribbon

3
00:00:06.394 --> 00:00:10.265
Drop photos of printed worksheets here, or click to choose

4
00:00:10.265 --> 00:00:14.339
The QR code was read and the page filed in its unit operation

5
00:00:14.339 --> 00:00:16.426
Undo takes it out again

6
00:00:16.426 --> 00:00:23.782
Open note shows where it went

7
00:00:23.782 --> 00:00:27.854
A thumbnail goes under Worksheet scans at the end of the step

8
00:00:27.854 --> 00:00:32.932
Open full size shows it at its original size
